Begin Exploring Related Columns
Relevant columns and their potential usage

• YEAR."_2017"."type": filter to WatchEvent rows.  
• YEAR."_2017"."repo": VARIANT that contains the repository’s fullname (key name = 'name'); use to identify which repository received the watch.  
• GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS."sample_repo_name": repository fullname; join to YEAR."_2017" watch counts.  
• GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS."sample_path": full file‑path; filter to files whose path ends with .py.  
• GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS."size": file size in bytes; filter to files smaller than 15 000 bytes.  
• GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS."content": text of the file; look for the substring 'def '.  
• GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS."id": unique file‑blob identifier; can be joined to GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_FILES if necessary.  

Typical conditions

• YEAR."_2017"."type" = 'WatchEvent'  
• GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS."sample_path" ILIKE '%.py'  
• GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS."size" < 15000  
• GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS."content" ILIKE '%def %'  

Ten exploratory Snowflake SQL queries
(Every statement is limited to 20 rows and all identifiers are wrapped in double quotes.)

```sql
-- 1. Description: Quick look at 2017 events to verify event types that exist.
SELECT 
  "type",
  "repo",
  "payload"
FROM GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.YEAR."_2017"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Description: Inspect the structure stored inside the VARIANT column "repo".
SELECT 
  "repo"
FROM GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.YEAR."_2017"
WHERE "type" = 'WatchEvent'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3. Description: Extract the repository name out of the repo VARIANT for WatchEvent rows.
SELECT 
  "repo":"name"::STRING AS "repo_name",
  "type"
FROM GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.YEAR."_2017"
WHERE "type" = 'WatchEvent'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Description: How many WatchEvent rows are recorded per repository in 2017?
SELECT 
  "repo":"name"::STRING AS "repo_name",
  COUNT(*) AS "watch_events_2017"
FROM GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.YEAR."_2017"
WHERE "type" = 'WatchEvent'
GROUP BY "repo_name"
ORDER BY "watch_events_2017" DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5. Description: Sample Python files kept in SAMPLE_CONTENTS (check paths & sizes).
SELECT 
  "sample_repo_name",
  "sample_path",
  "size"
FROM GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS
WHERE "sample_path" ILIKE '%.py'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6. Description: Python files smaller than 15 000 bytes.
SELECT 
  "sample_repo_name",
  "sample_path",
  "size"
FROM GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS
WHERE "sample_path" ILIKE '%.py'
  AND "size" < 15000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7. Description: Python files smaller than 15 000 bytes whose content contains the substring 'def '.
SELECT 
  "sample_repo_name",
  "sample_path",
  "size"
FROM GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS
WHERE "sample_path" ILIKE '%.py'
  AND "size" < 15000
  AND "content" ILIKE '%def %'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8. Description: Distinct repositories that satisfy the Python‑file condition described above.
SELECT DISTINCT
  "sample_repo_name"
FROM GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS
WHERE "sample_path" ILIKE '%.py'
  AND "size" < 15000
  AND "content" ILIKE '%def %'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9. Description: Combine WatchEvent counts with the filtered repository list (inner join).
SELECT 
  w."repo_name",
  w."watch_events_2017"
FROM (
    SELECT 
      "repo":"name"::STRING AS "repo_name",
      COUNT(*) AS "watch_events_2017"
    FROM GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.YEAR."_2017"
    WHERE "type" = 'WatchEvent'
    GROUP BY "repo_name"
) w
JOIN (
    SELECT DISTINCT
      "sample_repo_name"
    FROM GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS
    WHERE "sample_path" ILIKE '%.py'
      AND "size" < 15000
      AND "content" ILIKE '%def %'
) p
  ON w."repo_name" = p."sample_repo_name"
ORDER BY w."watch_events_2017" DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 10. Description: Final query – top three repositories in 2017 that match all Python‑file criteria, ranked by total watch‑events.
SELECT 
  w."repo_name",
  w."watch_events_2017"
FROM (
    SELECT 
      "repo":"name"::STRING AS "repo_name",
      COUNT(*) AS "watch_events_2017"
    FROM GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.YEAR."_2017"
    WHERE "type" = 'WatchEvent'
    GROUP BY "repo_name"
) w
JOIN (
    SELECT DISTINCT
      "sample_repo_name"
    FROM GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS
    WHERE "sample_path" ILIKE '%.py'
      AND "size" < 15000
      AND "content" ILIKE '%def %'
) p
  ON w."repo_name" = p."sample_repo_name"
ORDER BY w."watch_events_2017" DESC
LIMIT 3;
```
